<!-- Drag & drop between two trees -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">Drag &amp; Drop Between Two Trees</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>
      Two independent trees. Dragging a node <strong>within</strong> a tree reorders it (a move,
      auto-handled by the library); dragging a node <strong>across</strong> to the other tree
      copies its whole subtree in (placed by the demo in <code>onNodeDrop</code> via
      <code>copyNodeWithDescendants</code>, since the library can't move nodes that live in
      another tree). Multi-select drag, per-node pinning, and the built-in
      <code>Ctrl/Cmd + C / X / V</code> clipboard (a shared singleton across both trees) are all
      wired up.
    </p>
    <!-- Mount point for the drag-and-drop Svelte app. main.ts mounts <DndApp /> here. -->
    <div id="treeview-dnd-app"></div>
  </div>
</div>

